## Phase 4 — Microservices Decomposition

**Goal**: Split the monolith into 4 independent Spring Boot services, each with its own database, Dockerfile, ELK logging, and Prometheus metrics.

### Service Extraction Order

Extract in order of **lowest coupling first**:

```
① auth-service (fewest dependencies, clean boundary)
② notification-service (fire-and-forget, no one depends on it)  
③ booking-service (depends on catalog for show data)
④ catalog-service (the remaining monolith — rename and clean up)
```

